{"seq":2,"slug":"micro-foundations-of-violence","title":"冲突的微观基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/political-violence-conflict/mobilization-process/micro-foundations-of-violence","wordCount":1873,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"冲突的微观基础\">冲突的微观基础</h1><p>宏观理论告诉我们内战为何爆发、运动为何兴起，但它们都越过了一个最基本的事实：暴力是由具体的人实施的。某个二十岁的青年，在某个清晨，决定拿起枪走进丛林，或者在邻里冲突中亲手砍杀认识了一辈子的邻居。是什么让他迈出这一步，而他隔壁同样贫穷、同样受压迫的兄弟却选择了留下？这一篇下沉到个体层面，处理冲突研究中最难、也最颠覆直觉的问题——参与暴力的微观逻辑。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>微观基础研究要解决的首要难题是曼瑟·奥尔森（Mancur Olson）提出的<strong>集体行动困境</strong>。反叛若成功，其成果（推翻暴政、族群自治）是公共品——所有人都能享受，无论他是否参与。既然如此，理性的个体应该选择搭便车：让别人去冒险流血，自己坐享其成。可如果人人都这么算，反叛根本不会发生。但反叛确实发生了。这个悖论是理解参与的起点。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[集体行动困境&lt;br/&gt;反叛成果是公共品&lt;br/&gt;理性人应搭便车] --&gt; B{为何仍有人参与?}&#10;  B --&gt; C[选择性激励&lt;br/&gt;物质报酬·掠夺·薪饷]&#10;  B --&gt; D[社会激励&lt;br/&gt;网络·同侪压力·身份]&#10;  B --&gt; E[情感与道德&lt;br/&gt;羞辱·复仇·正义感]&#10;  B --&gt; F[强制&lt;br/&gt;被绑架·胁迫入伍]&#10;  C --&gt; G[个体参与]&#10;  D --&gt; G&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H{暴力的实际形态}&#10;  H --&gt; I[卡里瓦斯:暴力被地方恩怨私人化]\">flowchart TD\n  A[集体行动困境&lt;br/&gt;反叛成果是公共品&lt;br/&gt;理性人应搭便车] --&gt; B{为何仍有人参与?}\n  B --&gt; C[选择性激励&lt;br/&gt;物质报酬·掠夺·薪饷]\n  B --&gt; D[社会激励&lt;br/&gt;网络·同侪压力·身份]\n  B --&gt; E[情感与道德&lt;br/&gt;羞辱·复仇·正义感]\n  B --&gt; F[强制&lt;br/&gt;被绑架·胁迫入伍]\n  C --&gt; G[个体参与]\n  D --&gt; G\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H{暴力的实际形态}\n  H --&gt; I[卡里瓦斯:暴力被地方恩怨私人化]</pre><p>这把我们从<a href=\"contentious-politics-movements\">抗争政治与社会运动</a>的中观动员，进一步下沉到个体决策——动员结构提供了网络与机会，但最终扣动扳机的是个人。</p>\n<h2 id=\"为什么有人参与-四类驱动力\">为什么有人参与：四类驱动力</h2><p>针对集体行动困境，研究者提出了多重解释，它们并不互斥，往往在同一个人身上叠加。</p>\n<h3 id=\"选择性激励\">选择性激励</h3><p><strong>选择性激励</strong>是奥尔森本人的答案：只给参与者、不给搭便车者的私人好处。叛军提供薪饷、战利品分成、掠夺机会、社会地位——这与<a href=\"../concepts-theory/civil-war-armed-conflict\">内战与武装冲突理论</a>中的&quot;贪婪/机会&quot;论直接相连：可掠夺的资源不仅资助叛军，也是招募士兵的选择性激励。</p>\n<h3 id=\"社会网络与情感\">社会网络与情感</h3><p><strong>社会网络与同侪压力</strong>可能比物质激励更强大。麦克亚当对高风险行动主义的经典研究发现，是否参与高危抗争的最强预测变量不是意识形态强度，而是<strong>此人是否已嵌入参与者的社会网络</strong>——朋友去了，你很难不去。叛乱组织正是沿着既有的社会网络（村庄、宗族、学生社团、宗教团体）招募的。</p>\n<p><strong>情感与道德动机</strong>填补了纯理性模型的空白。羞辱、对至亲被害的复仇、对不公的道德义愤，这些情感能压倒成本收益计算。值得注意的是，<a href=\"../forms/state-violence-repression\">国家暴力与镇压</a>中讲的不当镇压恰恰通过制造个人化的复仇动机，把旁观者变成战士——这是镇压悖论的微观机制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"强制与胁迫\">强制与胁迫</h3><p><strong>强制</strong>则是阴暗的现实：许多武装组织（如部分童子军组织）靠绑架和胁迫补充兵员，参与并非选择。</p>\n<h2 id=\"卡里瓦斯-内战暴力的私人逻辑\">卡里瓦斯：内战暴力的私人逻辑</h2><p>斯塔西斯·卡里瓦斯（Stathis Kalyvas）的《内战中的暴力逻辑》（2006）带来了微观研究最深刻的洞见之一，彻底改变了我们对&quot;为何内战中平民被杀&quot;的理解。他的核心论点是：内战中的暴力远比宏大叙事所暗示的更<strong>私人化、更地方化</strong>。</p>\n<p>宏观上，一场内战可能被描述为&quot;族群之争&quot;或&quot;意识形态之争&quot;；但在村庄层面，许多杀戮其实是个人恩怨、土地纠纷、情感报复借战争之名得以了结。武装组织需要情报来识别敌人，而情报来自当地居民的告发——于是普通人得以利用战争的混乱，向私人仇敌&quot;扣上&quot;叛徒的帽子借刀杀人。这意味着内战暴力是<strong>宏观分裂与微观恩怨的合谋</strong>：意识形态提供了主线和资源，地方恩怨提供了具体的受害者名单。</p>\n<p>卡里瓦斯还提出了著名的&quot;控制-暴力&quot;理论：选择性暴力（精准杀害特定通敌者）需要可靠情报，而情报取决于控制——一方对某地区控制越牢，越能获得告发、越能实施选择性暴力；在控制犬牙交错、双方势均力敌的地区，反而最容易出现无差别的滥杀，因为没有一方能获得可靠情报。这一逻辑与<a href=\"../forms/state-violence-repression\">国家暴力与镇压</a>中&quot;选择性镇压比无差别镇压更有效&quot;高度一致。</p>\n<p>这一洞见的方法论冲击同样深远。它意味着我们不能仅凭交战双方的官方叙事来理解暴力——当叛军宣称某村是&quot;敌方据点&quot;而加以屠戮时，真实的因果链条可能是某个本地告发者借机清算宿怨。研究者因此必须下沉到村庄层面，用细致的微观田野和事件数据去还原&quot;谁告发了谁、谁杀了谁、为什么&quot;，而不能停留在意识形态标签上。这也警示政策制定者：旨在&quot;赢得人心&quot;的反叛乱策略，若忽视了地方权力结构如何把外来武装的暴力私人化，往往会在不知不觉中沦为本地派系斗争的工具，制造出比它试图平息的更多的怨恨。微观与宏观之间这道反复出现的鸿沟，正是<a href=\"../concepts-theory/intro-and-core-concepts\">政治暴力导论</a>强调&quot;分析层次不可混淆&quot;的最有力例证。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一个简单的参与模型\">一个简单的参与模型</h2><p>把上述驱动力整合，个体 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 参与暴力的决策可粗略表示为：当参与的净收益为正时参与。设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为选择性激励（物质+社会+情感），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为公共品收益乘以个人对&quot;我的参与是否关键&quot;的主观信念 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 为参与成本（受伤、死亡、镇压风险），则</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>参与</mtext><mi>i</mi></msub><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{参与}_i \\iff S_i + \\beta_i \\cdot P_i - C_i &gt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">参与</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个简化式的洞见在于：由于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（单个人改变结局的概率）通常极小，公共品项 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>β</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⋅</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta_i \\cdot P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0528em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 几乎可忽略——这正是集体行动困境。因此真正驱动参与的是<strong>选择性激励 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></strong>（私人好处、网络、情感），而非反叛的崇高目标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。这解释了为何最坚定的战士往往是被网络和情感而非纲领绑定的人。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>解释路径</th>\n<th>关键机制</th>\n<th>与本 hub 其他篇的连接</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>选择性激励</td>\n<td>薪饷、掠夺、地位</td>\n<td><a href=\"war-economies-resources\">战争经济与资源</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>社会网络</td>\n<td>同侪、宗族、社团</td>\n<td><a href=\"contentious-politics-movements\">抗争政治</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>情感道德</td>\n<td>复仇、羞辱、义愤</td>\n<td><a href=\"../forms/state-violence-repression\">国家暴力与镇压</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>私人化暴力</td>\n<td>地方恩怨借战争了结</td>\n<td><a href=\"../forms/ethnic-conflict-genocide\">族群冲突</a></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>微观研究的起点是集体行动困境：反叛成果是公共品，理性人本应搭便车，但反叛仍然发生。</li>\n<li>参与由四类驱动力解释——选择性激励、社会网络与同侪压力、情感道德动机、强制——它们常叠加。</li>\n<li>社会网络往往比物质激励更能预测高风险参与；不当镇压通过制造个人复仇动机把旁观者变战士。</li>\n<li>卡里瓦斯揭示内战暴力高度私人化、地方化，是宏观分裂与微观恩怨的合谋；控制程度决定暴力的选择性。</li>\n<li>简化的参与模型显示，由于个人影响结局的概率极小，真正驱动参与的是选择性激励而非崇高纲领。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"冲突的微观基础","id":"冲突的微观基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么有人参与：四类驱动力","id":"为什么有人参与-四类驱动力"},{"level":3,"text":"选择性激励","id":"选择性激励"},{"level":3,"text":"社会网络与情感","id":"社会网络与情感"},{"level":3,"text":"强制与胁迫","id":"强制与胁迫"},{"level":2,"text":"卡里瓦斯：内战暴力的私人逻辑","id":"卡里瓦斯-内战暴力的私人逻辑"},{"level":2,"text":"一个简单的参与模型","id":"一个简单的参与模型"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"抗争政治与社会运动","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/political-violence-conflict/mobilization-process/contentious-politics-movements"},"next":{"title":"冲突的经济与资源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/political-science/political-violence-conflict/mobilization-process/war-economies-resources"}}